// A MODULE THAT DECLARES NOTHING (1.5.1b step 3c, the workbench's O-N14 --
// their `core.npk`): no function, no trap site of its own -- and its unit
// still carries seven `call @npk_failsafe` in the prelude's resume
// scaffolding, so it is the smallest module that needs the declare, and the
// `object` stage's first unit.
mod:quiet;
